# Docker build context hygiene: only the studio source + docker/ are needed.
# node_modules, dist and browser profiles would otherwise ride into every build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.git
browser-profile
studio/browser-profile
.vscode
.idea
*.log
*.AppImage
*.deb
*.flatpak
*.zip
installer/cachyos-lazyvim
